      "source": [
        "A few things stand out:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Distribution (left plot)**\n",
        "- Right-skewed with a mode around \\$20,000\n",
        "- The spike at \\$50,000 is suspicious. `medv` is **top-coded** (right-censored): homes worth more than \\$50,000 were all recorded as exactly 50, so the true values above the ceiling are unknown. This needs flagging in a report.\n",
